imud-mqtt (1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The temperature topic now reports the real IMU die temperature (the
    daemon previously always published a 25.0 degC placeholder).
  * SIGHUP-reloadable fields shared with the mosquitto network thread are
    now C11 _Atomic.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700

imud-mqtt (1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New sea-state topics under environment/ (waveHeight, wavePeriod,
    rollPeriod, rollAmplitude, pitchPeriod, pitchAmplitude), riding
    publish_heave and gated on the packet's WAVE_VALID flag.
  * New engine/running ON/OFF topic with Home Assistant binary_sensor
    discovery (device_class: running).
  * Rebuilt against wire v14.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 11:35:35 -0700

imud-mqtt (1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Link libimud for stream access and packet validation (drops the local
    copy of the socket code). Runtime dependency: libimud.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud-mqtt (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against imud packet v12 (228 bytes).
  * Add an environment/heaveRate topic (m/s) with Home Assistant discovery.
  * Gate heave/heaveRate on the new HEAVE_VALID flag: their state is withheld
    until the heave estimator settles (~10·τ), so subscribers never see the
    startup transient. HA discovery is still advertised on publish_heave alone,
    so the entity exists and reads "unavailable" until then.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 03:00:00 -0700

